1
00:00:00,565 --> 00:00:02,605
(Leonard:)Where do I sign?

2
00:00:04,068 --> 00:00:06,198
(Sheldon:)Right here. Use your finger.

3
00:00:07,447 --> 00:00:09,447
- There. Done.
All right.

4
00:00:09,615 --> 00:00:13,665
(Sheldon:)That's it. We are now
no longer companions, boon or otherwise.

5
00:00:13,828 --> 00:00:15,828
(Sheldon:)We are now merely acquaintances.

6
00:00:15,997 --> 00:00:19,787
(Sheldon:)To amend the words of Toy Story,
you have not got a friend in me.

7
00:00:21,627 --> 00:00:25,677
- I'm gonna go home and take a nap.
- Yeah, well, tell it to someone who cares.

8
00:00:27,175 --> 00:00:29,465
(Howard:)I got pretty exciting NASA news today.

9
00:00:29,635 --> 00:00:35,395
(Howard:)Next week, I fly to Houston for orientation
and zero-gravity elimination drills.

10
00:00:35,558 --> 00:00:39,098
- What does that mean?
- He's gonna learn to poop in space.

11
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:44,029
(Howard:)Open the pod bay doors, HAL.

12
00:00:45,568 --> 00:00:48,488
(Raj:)Maybe your nickname
should be Brown Dynamite.

13
00:00:51,574 --> 00:00:55,324
(Sheldon:)Hello, dear friends. And Dr. Hofstadter.

14
00:00:56,621 --> 00:01:00,411
What's up?

